  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Pacific Fisheries - Regional Capacity and Coordination</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the next phase of New&#xa0;Zealand&#x2019;s development assistance (2024-2028) into ensuring the regional enabling environment for Pacific fisheries is robust, and that regional and multilateral efforts are being harnessed for more efficient, effective and transformative responses to country needs thus addressing persistent regional challenges to sustainable fisheries management, including Illegal, Unreported and Unregulated (IUU) fishing (particularly for offshore fisheries).</narrative>
  </description>
